  {
   "id": "torii-141335@1.9.6",
   "gameId": "torii-141335",
   "displayName": "Update 1.9.6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-23T17:47:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Choose your play style!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ARCADE MODE -: • Added \"exploration marks\" as an option when resting to make exploration easier and stamina regeneration times augmented. Recommended for streamers, anyone who want a lighter experience or those who want a second run to find all memories easier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMMERSIVE | EFFORT MODE -: • The classic mode, demands more effort and attention. No navigation marks and stamina regeneration times are normal.: When you start a new game you can select your style and then change it whenever you want through the settings panel!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENTS -: • Stamina augmented in general to make exploration more enjoyable.: • Now red hums won't spawn if you already have red hum energy to make puzzles more intuitive.: • Added a sound effect to know exactly when you successfully catch a red hum.: • Improved settings and menu panel when using controller.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIXES -: • Text correction.: • Fixed a bug where you could sit entering the astral if you repeatedly pressed the action button when approaching a prism.: • Fixed an issue with the camera locked focusing the player.: • Fixed a rare bug where the music slider was out of range.: • Fixed a bug where cards would remain highlighted after closing the pause panel.: • Minor fixes.: ACCESSIBILITY: • Now players can unlock the cursor in the settings menu if needed.: Thanks! for all the love and support I'm receiving these days. I'm trying to make my best improving Torii with your feedback <3.: Please, feel free to join our community Discord server!: Follow me on Instagram and Twitter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
